{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Integrative Care for Whole-You</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A gentle, evidence-informed approach to whole-person health. Educational intake, tailored plans, and sustainable habits.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="layout-split">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <button class="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-list">Menu</button>
        <ul id="nav-list" class="nav-list">
          <li><a href="/services.html">Offerings</a></li>
          <li><a href="/conditions.html">Concerns</a></li>
          <li><a href="/approach.html">Our Way</a></li>
          <li><a href="/book.html">Reserve</a></li>
          <li><a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero split-diagonal">
      <div class="panel panel-left">
        <div class="pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="hero-copy container">
          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <p class="lead">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
          <p class="poem">A careful listening. Maps that honor body and story. Small practices, steady change.</p>
          <p class="contact">Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
          <p><a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel panel-right">
        <div class="hero-visual" role="img" aria-label="gentle abstract shapes">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 600 400" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" class="hero-svg">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#E6FFFA" />
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#D6F5E8" />
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <rect width="600" height="400" fill="url(#g1)" rx="24"/>
            <g fill-opacity="0.18" fill="#004D40">
              <circle cx="120" cy="80" r="64"/>
              <circle cx="480" cy="320" r="96"/>
              <ellipse cx="360" cy="160" rx="140" ry="60"/>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="diagnostic" class="diagnostic container">
      <h2>Begin with clarity</h2>
      <p class="intro">Every plan starts with a wide-angle view: clinical history, lifestyle, personal priorities. We translate symptoms into patterns — not promises, but options to explore together.</p>
      <div class="diagnostic-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Intake conversation</h3>
          <p>Comprehensive story-taking to find upstream drivers and shared values for care.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Observations</h3>
          <p>Practical exams and focused questions to illuminate functional strengths and strains.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Educational review</h3>
          <p>Clear, jargon-light explanations so decisions feel informed, not rushed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="plan" class="plan split-diagonal-alt">
      <div class="panel panel-right">
        <div class="panel-inner container">
          <h2>Tailored plan</h2>
          <p class="intro">Plans are layered: immediate supports, medium-term habits, and periodic reassessment. Labs or supplements are optional and discussed as educational tools.</p>
          <ol class="steps">
            <li><strong>Priorities.</strong> What matters most to you this month?</li>
            <li><strong>Targets.</strong> Small measurable steps that respect your life.</li>
            <li><strong>Supports.</strong> Diet, movement, sleep practices, stress tools, and when relevant, labs.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel panel-left accent">
        <div class="panel-inner">
          <svg class="icon" width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path fill="#fff" d="M12 2C8.1 2 5 5.1 5 9c0 4.4 4.4 8.9 6.3 10.4.4.3 1.1.3 1.5 0C14.6 17.9 19 13.4 19 9c0-3.9-3.1-7-7-7zM11 11V6h2v7h-6v-2h4z"/>
          </svg>
          <p class="tagline">A plan is a compass, not a contract.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="micro_habits" class="micro-habits container">
      <h2>Daily pieces, sustainable whole</h2>
      <p class="intro">Micro-habits accumulate. We favor tiny, specific acts you can repeat and measure.</p>
      <ul class="habits">
        <li><strong>Breath pause:</strong> 2 minutes on waking to settle the nervous system.</li>
        <li><strong>Movement window:</strong> brief 8–12 minute movement session midday.</li>
        <li><strong>Evening wind-down:</strong> one tech-free ritual before sleep.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note">Small is not shallow. Over weeks, these shifts reshape thresholds.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing" class="pricing split-diagonal">
      <div class="panel panel-left">
        <div class="container">
          <h2>Sessions & offerings</h2>
          <div class="price-grid">
            <div class="price-card">
              <h3>Intro Visit</h3>
              <p class="price">60–75 min • $175</p>
              <p>Deep intake and collaborative goal-setting. Ideal first visit.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="price-card">
              <h3>Follow-up</h3>
              <p class="price">30–45 min • $95</p>
              <p>Check-ins to refine habits, review labs, and adjust supports.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="price-card">
              <h3>Series (4)</h3>
              <p class="price">Bundle pricing • $340</p>
              <p>Four visits for an intentional reset and accountability arc.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="disclaimer">Prices subject to change. Insurance and sliding-scale options discussed on booking.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel panel-right visual">
        <div class="container">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" class="leaf" aria-hidden="true">
            <g fill="#00695C" fill-opacity="0.14">
              <path d="M20 160 C40 120, 80 100, 100 80 C120 60, 160 30, 180 10" stroke="#004D40" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="30"/>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="cta" class="cta container">
      <h2>Ready to explore?</h2>
      <p>Book an introductory conversation to map practical next steps. Education first — no cures promised, only thoughtful partnership.</p>
      <p><a class="primary large" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></p>
      <p class="practitioner">Led by {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="footer-nav">
        <a href="/about.html">About</a>
        <a href="/approach.html">Approach</a>
        <a href="/contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
      <p class="small">&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — A gentle, integrative practice. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
